			"description": "Psychic Hood",
			"local_notes": "Lore: A warded circlet built around a tiny, heavily sanctioned psychic node (sometimes a bound, lobotomised psyker's brain-stem), worn by Astra Militarum officers and Inquisitorial staff to blunt enemy sorcery directed at their command. Consistent with Dark Heresy/Rogue Trader's psychic hood/psy-focus items and Codex background on Imperial command-squad wargear.\n\nDesign: Modelled as a flat +2 conditional bonus (Basic's conditional_modifier feature) to resist Warp-tagged mental attacks — comparable in size to Basic's own Power Defense-type items, cheap enough to matter but never a substitute for a trained anti-psyker.",
